<title>TUNISIA: Tunis bourse closes almost unchanged.</title>
<headline>Tunis bourse closes almost unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunis Stock Exchange on Friday closed almost unchanged in lower trade, bourse sources said.</p>
<p>The market's 30-share index closed at 617.32 from 617.43 on Thursday.</p>
<p>Trade volume was 1.030 million dinars against 1.254 million dinars.</p>
<p>Banque du Sud was up 5.71 percent to 30.9 dinars.</p>
<p>Airliner Tunis Air was down 2.94 percent to 16.14 dinars.</p>
<p>($1=0.96 dinar)</p>
</text>
